{
  "name": "03 - AI Summarization & Keyword Extraction",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 \u00b7 AI Summarization & Keyword Extraction\nHourly \u2192 up to 20 papers where `processed = false` (written by **02**) \u2192 LLM structured summary \u2192 **validated in code** \u2192 update `research_papers`.\n\u2714 valid \u2192 `processing_status = summarized`\n\u2716 AI failure / bad JSON \u2192 `processing_status = ai_failed` + `processing_error` (not retried automatically; set `processed=false` to retry).\nOutput feeds **04** and **05**.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 600
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -480
      ],
      "id": "0b108d82-2ac2-41c2-839d-d69f8f19b502",
      "name": "Note 1bde3b"
